    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "James G Coughlan & Associates are delighted to off 12 Frankfield Villas, Windmill Road to the market for Sale.  This exceptionally well-located mid terrace property is literally walking distance of Cork city centre, St Finbarrs Hospital, the South Infirmary Hospital and every conceivable convenience.  Although in need of total refurbishment inside and out including structural work, it qualifies for the vacant homes grant (up to €50,000) with further substantial grants available depending on applicant.  Accommodation consists of Reception, Living Room, Family/Dining Room, Kitchen, Downstairs Bathroom, 3 Bedrooms upstairs, Toilet & wash hand basin, landing. Comes very realistically price."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "RECEPTION:\r\n13ft x 4ft. Teak glazed front door, radiator, 1 light, stairs to upper floor.\r\n\r\n                    \t\t \r\nLIVING ROOM:\r\n12ft x 10ft.8. Bay window, tiled open fireplace, radiator, 1 light.\r\n\t \r\n\r\nFAMILY/DINING ROOM:\r\n12ft x 11ft. Tiled open fireplace, built-in unit, 1 window, radiator and light.\r\n\r\n\r\nKITCHEN EXTENSION:\r\n10ft x 8ft. Oak built-in wall and floor units, single drainer stainless steel sink, plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher, gas hob, oven, 1 light and 1 window.\r\n\r\n\r\nREAR PORCH:\r\nTeak back door, hot press with dual immersion.\r\n\r\n\r\nDOWNSTAIRS BATHROOM:\r\n8ft x 5ft.7. Walk-in shower cubicle with Mira electric shower, toilet and wash hand basin, tiled walls, radiator, 1 light and 1 window.\r\n\r\n                 \t\t \r\nBEDROOM NO. 1:\r\n11ft x 8ft. Full width built-in wardrobes, radiator, 1 light and 1 window.\r\n\r\n\r\nBEDROOM NO. 2:\r\n9ft x 9ft.6. Full width built-in wardrobes, radiator, 1 light and 1 window.\r\n\t \r\n\r\nBEDROOM NO. 3:\r\n7ft.8 x 6ft.3. Radiator, 1 light and 1 window.\r\n\r\n\r\nLANDING:\r\n1 light, 1 window, pull down stira stairs.\r\n\r\n\r\nTOILET OFF with wash hand basin.\r\n\t \r\n\r\nOUTSIDE:\r\nGardens front and rear, fully walled in all round, not overlooked front or rear.  South facing garden and patio area to the rear, outside tap.\r\n             \t\r\n\r\nMessrs. James G. Coughlan & Associates for themselves and for the vendors or lessors of this property whose Agents they are given notice that:1)  The particulars are set out as a general outline for the guidance of intending purchaser or lessees, and do not constitute, nor constitute part of, an offer or contract.  2)  All descriptions, dimensions, references to condition and necessary permissions for use and occupation and other details are given in good faith and are believed to be correct but any      intending purchasers or tenants should not rely on them as statements or representations of fact but must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them.  3)  No Person in the employment of Messrs. James G. Coughlan & Associates has the authority to make or give representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property"
      },
